# Runnable requests for VS Code REST Client, Visual Studio and Rider (DESIGN.md §7.4).
# Start the API and both mocks first (README / AGENTS.md §7), or `docker compose up`.

@api = http://localhost:8080
@sales = http://localhost:8081
@service = http://localhost:8082
@vin = MA3EWB81S00100001

### All documents for a vehicle (first call: X-Cache MISS, second: HIT)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/vehicles/{{vin}}/documents

### Bypass the cache
GET {{api}}/api/v1/vehicles/{{vin}}/documents?refresh=true

### Only expired documents (vehicle #5 has an expired insurance policy)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/vehicles/MA3EWB81S00100005/documents?status=EXPIRED

### Pagination (opt-in): 20 per page; pass nextCursor back as cursor for the next page (D-031)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/vehicles/MA3EWB81S00100008/documents?limit=20

### Filters can be combined and repeated
GET {{api}}/api/v1/vehicles/{{vin}}/documents?source=SERVICE&type=PUC,JOB_CARD

### Invalid VIN -> 400 problem, no source is called
GET {{api}}/api/v1/vehicles/BADVIN/documents

### Unknown vehicle -> 200 with an empty list
GET {{api}}/api/v1/vehicles/MA3EWB81S00100099/documents

### Circuit state and last outcome per source
GET {{api}}/api/v1/sources/health

### Liveness / readiness
GET {{api}}/healthz

###
GET {{api}}/readyz

### --- Failure demo ---------------------------------------------------------

### Make the Service mock hang (exceeds the 2 s budget)
POST {{service}}/__admin/fault
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "timeout" }

### Now the search is partial: Service shows "timeout", or "stale" if a snapshot exists
GET {{api}}/api/v1/vehicles/{{vin}}/documents?refresh=true

### Break Sales too -> vehicle without snapshot gets 503 + Retry-After
POST {{sales}}/__admin/fault
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "error" }

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/vehicles/MA3EWB81S00100010/documents

### Heal both mocks
POST {{sales}}/__admin/fault
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "none" }

###
POST {{service}}/__admin/fault
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "none" }
